    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Marcus gets the notes over by end of day tomorrow, with the recheck passing. Other points about grouping, the export change, the rollout, the help center drafts and the API rate limit mention were stated.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- Ingrid, Marcus and Priya confirmed that Marcus gets the notes over by end of day tomorrow, with the recheck passing.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- Someone asked Marcus to get the release notes by end of day tomorrow.\n- Someone said end of day tomorrow works.\n- Someone said they will group them by feature, fixes and deprecations.\n- Someone asked to call out the export change.\n- Someone said they will put it at the top with a short how-to.\n- Someone said the rollout starts Thursday at 08:00 their time with ten percent first.\n- Someone said they will have the help center drafts ready to flip on Thursday.\n- Someone asked whether to mention the API rate limit change or keep it for the developer newsletter.\n- Someone said to mention it in one line and link to the developer docs.\n- Someone said that works for them."
